- [S1] STC8 failed: Each action node must have exactly one incoming and one outgoing edge. | Node `n9` has in=1 and out=0. | DSL: action(n9,"Register the case")
- [S2] STC11 failed: Each variable definition must have a valid range with at least two distinct values. | Variable `v1` has an invalid range `[]`.
- [S3] STC16 failed: Every outgoing edge of XOR/OR branches must have exactly one guard. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> n13` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> n14` has 0 guards; exactly one is required.
- [S4] STC20 failed: Every non-end node must have a path to at least one end node. | Violations: n9 | DSL: action(n9,"Register the case")